<title>KENYA: Kenya police say eight killed in Mombasa.</title>
<headline>Kenya police say eight killed in Mombasa.</headline>
<dateline>MOMBASA, Kenya 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenyan police said on Thursday six police officers and two assailants were killed when unidentified attackers set fire to a police station at Mombasa.</p>
<p>A police statement said several civilians were seriously injured in Wednesday night's violence and some police weapons were stolen.</p>
<p>&quot;A major security operation was immediately launched to net the culprits,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
